<title>SOUTH AFRICA: KLIPTON SAYS DUE DILIGENCE ON BUY EXTENDED.</title>
<headline>KLIPTON SAYS DUE DILIGENCE ON BUY EXTENDED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klipton Ltd said on Wednesday that its due diligence investigation into the business of the Armed Response Group (Pty) Ltd had been extended.</p>
<p>Klipton on May 9 announced it had acquired the security firm's operations.</p>
<p>It said a further announcement would be made in due course.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
